        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>2 Foot Modern Stainless Steel Glass Door Handles</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2 Foot Modern Glass Door Handle Set comes packaged as a pair with everything you'll need to mount it back-to-back on a glass door. It is 24 inches long with 14-3/8 inch mounting centers. This stainless steel door pull has a satin finish which is great at standing up to even the most brutal conditions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG443-610-speifications.gif?v=1704354621\" width=\"587\" height=\"255\" border=\"0\" alt=\"2 Foot Modern Glass Door Handle Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Shorter <a href=\"/products/14-inch-square-glass-door-handles-pair-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>14\" Square Stainless Steel Glass Door Handle</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 2 Foot Square Stainless Glass Door Handles:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 24\" (610 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 14-3/8\" (365 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-3/16\" (81 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/8\" (29 mm) Square</li>\r\n<li>Door Mounting: 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged with 2 door pulls and mounting hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors.</i>\r\n</p>",
